  "id": "performance-evaluation",
  "term": "performance evaluation",
  "definition": "Performance evaluation is a person’s judgment of how well they performed an activity or task. In this packet, it refers specifically to self-evaluation based on subjective experience, such as how effectively one used their abilities, the quality of execution, and overall satisfaction, rather than only on objective results.",
